  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>224</mn><mi>gm</mi></math></p><p>Moles of acetic acid <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0204</mn></math>&nbsp;moles in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math></p><p>So molality&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0102</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>kg</mi></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></math> for acetic acid</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0198</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0102</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>04928</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8773;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math></p>",
